\pard\sb300\sa200\sl240\slmult1\qj\b Annex to Voicemod Terms Regarding Beta Functionality of Sound Room (aka Voice Chats)\par

\pard{\pntext\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1\qj\b0 Voicemod\rquote s Sound Rooms (AKA "Voice Chats") is a \b fun sound-sharing service\b0  \emdash  not a messaging app or calling platform. You \b can\rquote t make calls\b0 , \b send messages\b0 , or \b contact emergency services\b0 . Please use your phone or another app for that.\par
{\pntext\'B7\tab}This is a beta feature. It may not work as expected and can be removed or changed without any prior notice.\par
{\pntext\'B7\tab}By using or accessing a Sound room, you are agreeing to the General Terms of use of Voicemod that you can find {\cf1\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.voicemod.net/en/terms-of-use/"}}{\fldrslt{here}}}}\f0\fs20  as well as this Annex for the Beta Voice Chats. In particular, we\rquote d like to remind you that you that Voicemod Products can\rquote t be used by people under 16 years old and, if you are older than 16 but still a minor, require the Terms acceptance by your parents. Also, remember that you are accountable for the content you upload and the use you make of Voicemod voice filters and sounds and will be responsible in case of law infringement; you should use them responsibly and in accordance with our {\cf1\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.voicemod.net/en/legal/"}}{\fldrslt{Guidelines}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par
{\pntext\'B7\tab}This functionality lets you:\par

\pard{\pntext\bullet\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\bullet}}\fi-360\li1440\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql Join or create a \b sound room\b0  and invite your friends to it through a link.\par
{\pntext\bullet\tab}Drop short sounds or voice clips, using \b Voicemod\rquote s voice filters and effects.\b0\par
{\pntext\bullet\tab}Replay any of the \b last 50 sounds\b0  in a room.\par

\pard{\pntext\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql Be Cool, Not Creepy. \b Do not\b0 :\par

\pard{\pntext\bullet\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\bullet}}\fi-360\li1440\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql Use this app to send messages, coordinate chats, or contact people outside\par
{\pntext\bullet\tab}Share personal, sensitive, or private info \emdash  like health details, passwords, or bank info\par
{\pntext\bullet\tab}Spam others or upload gross/illegal/offensive stuff, bully anyone. If you send too many sounds or clips too quickly, \b you\rquote ll be put in time out\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\bullet\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\bullet}}\fi-360\li1440\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql Pretend this is a messaging app \emdash  because it\rquote s not!\par

\pard{\pntext\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql Privacy\par

\pard\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql\tab Voicemod won\rquote t be listening to the sound chats nor your voice recordings. We need access to the microphone so that we can process your voice to add it to the clip and to apply the voice filters you choose.\par
\tab However, keep in mind that this is not a communication tool and the sounds or voice clips won\rquote t be private: once you launch them, everyone in the room \b hears it instantly\b0 , like a \b walkie-talkie\b0  \emdash  no need to press play. The sounds can then be \b replayed\b0  by your friends in the room and could be heard by anyone who is with them, since they won\rquote t have the chance to choose when to "play" them.\par
\tab For example, if you send a fart noise and your friend\rquote s boss is in the room (or his mum, lover\ldots  you name it), they will all hear it through the speakers. Also, if you share a voice clip in a room, your friends could pick it and replay it again. This is why this tool is meant to be used for fun and you should not share any personal or sensitive information. Don\rquote t let the person you like find out because your friends re-played a 3 second clip where you declared your love. Don\rquote t let your passwords or personal information become part of a friend\rquote s game.\par

\pard\sa200\sl240\slmult1\ql See our {\cf1\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.voicemod.net/en/privacy/"}}{\fldrslt{Privacy Policy}}}}\f0\fs20  for more information.\par

